{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43835","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73266","text":"02 — Deployment Pipeline"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43837","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73267","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-73268","text":" How bundles are uploaded, validated, and deployed to runtime providers. Covers the immutable deployment model, version monotonicity, rollback mechanics, and the AgentCore container build pipeline."}]}],"id":"blk-43836","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-43838","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73269","text":"Deployment Model"}]},{"id":"blk-43839","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73270","text":"Deployments are "},{"id":"spn-73271","marks":["bold"],"text":"immutable records"},{"id":"spn-73272","text":". Once created, a deployment's artifact, version, and configuration never change. Only "},{"id":"spn-73273","marks":["code"],"text":"status"},{"id":"spn-73274","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-73275","marks":["code"],"text":"error_message"},{"id":"spn-73276","text":" are updated during the lifecycle. Rollback works by switching the agent's "},{"id":"spn-73277","marks":["code"],"text":"active_deployment_id"},{"id":"spn-73278","text":" pointer -- not by modifying old deployments."}]},{"id":"blk-43840","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73279","text":"Deployment Fields"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43842","spans":[{"id":"spn-73280","text":"Field"}]},{"id":"blk-43843","spans":[{"id":"spn-73281","text":"Type"}]},{"id":"blk-43844","spans":[{"id":"spn-73282","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-43841","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43845","spans":[{"id":"spn-73283","marks":["code"],"text":"id"}]},{"id":"blk-43846","spans":[{"id":"spn-73284","text":"UUID"}]},{"id":"blk-43847","spans":[{"id":"spn-73285","text":"Immutable deployment identifier"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43848","spans":[{"id":"spn-73286","marks":["code"],"text":"agent_id"}]},{"id":"blk-43849","spans":[{"id":"spn-73287","text":"UUID"}]},{"id":"blk-43850","spans":[{"id":"spn-73288","text":"Parent agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43851","spans":[{"id":"spn-73289","marks":["code"],"text":"version"}]},{"id":"blk-43852","spans":[{"id":"spn-73290","text":"int"}]},{"id":"blk-43853","spans":[{"id":"spn-73291","text":"Monotonically increasing per agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43854","spans":[{"id":"spn-73292","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime_provider"}]},{"id":"blk-43855","spans":[{"id":"spn-73293","text":"enum"}]},{"id":"blk-43856","spans":[{"id":"spn-73294","marks":["code"],"text":"cloudflare"},{"id":"spn-73295","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-73296","marks":["code"],"text":"agentcore"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43857","spans":[{"id":"spn-73297","marks":["code"],"text":"status"}]},{"id":"blk-43858","spans":[{"id":"spn-73298","text":"enum"}]},{"id":"blk-43859","spans":[{"id":"spn-73299","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-73300","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-73301","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-73302","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-73303","marks":["code"],"text":"failed"},{"id":"spn-73304","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-73305","marks":["code"],"text":"rolled_back"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43860","spans":[{"id":"spn-73306","marks":["code"],"text":"artifact"}]},{"id":"blk-43861","spans":[{"id":"spn-73307","text":"JSONB"}]},{"id":"blk-43862","spans":[{"id":"spn-73308","text":"Upload reference (checksum, size)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43863","spans":[{"id":"spn-73309","marks":["code"],"text":"provider_ref"}]},{"id":"blk-43864","spans":[{"id":"spn-73310","text":"JSONB"}]},{"id":"blk-43865","spans":[{"id":"spn-73311","text":"Provider-specific deployment reference"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43866","spans":[{"id":"spn-73312","marks":["code"],"text":"commit_hash"}]},{"id":"blk-43867","spans":[{"id":"spn-73313","text":"string?"}]},{"id":"blk-43868","spans":[{"id":"spn-73314","text":"Optional git commit"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43869","spans":[{"id":"spn-73315","marks":["code"],"text":"error_message"}]},{"id":"blk-43870","spans":[{"id":"spn-73316","text":"string?"}]},{"id":"blk-43871","spans":[{"id":"spn-73317","text":"Failure details (sanitized, no secrets)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-43872","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73318","text":"Deploy Flow"}]},{"id":"blk-43873","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. UI uploads bundle (zip/tar)\n2. POST /functions/v1/deploy\n3. Edge Function:\n   a. Validate bundle (see validation rules below)\n   b. INSERT deployment (status: deploying)\n   c. Call RPI adapter: deploy(artifact, config, secrets)\n   d. On success:\n      - UPDATE deployment status -> active\n      - SET agents.active_deployment_id = deployment.id\n      - SET agents.status -> active\n   e. On failure:\n      - UPDATE deployment status -> failed\n      - SET error_message\n      - SET agents.status -> error"},{"id":"blk-43874","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73319","text":"Required Manifest: "},{"id":"spn-73320","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"}]},{"id":"blk-43875","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73321","text":"Every bundle must include this file at the root:"}]},{"id":"blk-43876","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"entrypoint\": \"src/index.ts\",\n  \"runtime\": \"cloudflare\",\n  \"protocol\": \"invoke/v1\",\n  \"env\": {\n    \"requiredKeys\": [\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"],\n    \"optionalKeys\": [\"DEBUG\"]\n  },\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"streaming\": true,\n    \"tools\": false\n  }\n}"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43878","spans":[{"id":"spn-73322","text":"Field"}]},{"id":"blk-43879","spans":[{"id":"spn-73323","text":"Required"}]},{"id":"blk-43880","spans":[{"id":"spn-73324","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-43877","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43881","spans":[{"id":"spn-73325","marks":["code"],"text":"entrypoint"}]},{"id":"blk-43882","spans":[{"id":"spn-73326","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43883","spans":[{"id":"spn-73327","text":"Path to main file"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43884","spans":[{"id":"spn-73328","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime"}]},{"id":"blk-43885","spans":[{"id":"spn-73329","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43886","spans":[{"id":"spn-73330","text":"Must match agent's "},{"id":"spn-73331","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime_provider"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43887","spans":[{"id":"spn-73332","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-43888","spans":[{"id":"spn-73333","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43889","spans":[{"id":"spn-73334","text":"Must be "},{"id":"spn-73335","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43890","spans":[{"id":"spn-73336","marks":["code"],"text":"env.requiredKeys"}]},{"id":"blk-43891","spans":[{"id":"spn-73337","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43892","spans":[{"id":"spn-73338","text":"Secret keys that must exist in Vault"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43893","spans":[{"id":"spn-73339","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities"}]},{"id":"blk-43894","spans":[{"id":"spn-73340","text":"Yes"}]},{"id":"blk-43895","spans":[{"id":"spn-73341","text":"Feature flags"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-43896","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73342","text":"Validation Rules (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-43897","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43899","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73343","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-73344","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"},{"id":"spn-73345","text":" exists and parses as valid JSON"}]}],"id":"blk-43898","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43901","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73346","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-73347","marks":["code"],"text":"entrypoint"},{"id":"spn-73348","text":" file exists in the bundle"}]}],"id":"blk-43900","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43903","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73349","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-73350","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime"},{"id":"spn-73351","text":" matches the agent's "},{"id":"spn-73352","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime_provider"}]}],"id":"blk-43902","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43905","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73353","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-73354","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol"},{"id":"spn-73355","text":" is "},{"id":"spn-73356","marks":["code"],"text":"invoke/v1"}]}],"id":"blk-43904","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43907","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73357","text":"[ ] Bundle size within limits (compressed and extracted)"}]}],"id":"blk-43906","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73358","text":"[ ] File count within limits"}]}],"id":"blk-43908","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43911","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73359","text":"[ ] No path traversal entries or unsafe symlinks"}]}],"id":"blk-43910","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73360","text":"[ ] Version is strictly greater than the previous deployment's version"}]}],"id":"blk-43912","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43914","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73361","text":"Version Monotonicity"}]},{"id":"blk-43915","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73362","text":"Versions are monotonically increasing integers per agent. The platform auto-assigns the next version if not provided. Attempting to deploy a version less than or equal to the current maximum is rejected."}]},{"id":"blk-43916","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agent_id | version | status\n---------+---------+--------\nabc      | 1       | rolled_back\nabc      | 2       | rolled_back\nabc      | 3       | active     <-- current"},{"id":"blk-43917","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73363","text":"Rollback"}]},{"id":"blk-43918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73364","text":"Rollback does "},{"id":"spn-73365","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-73366","text":" create a new deployment. It switches the active pointer:"}]},{"id":"blk-43919","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"curl -X POST \"$SUPABASE_URL/rest/v1/rpc/rollback_deployment\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -d '{ \"agent_id\": \"<uuid>\", \"deployment_id\": \"<target-uuid>\" }'"},{"id":"blk-43920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73367","text":"The target deployment must have status "},{"id":"spn-73368","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-73369","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-73370","marks":["code"],"text":"rolled_back"},{"id":"spn-73371","text":" and belong to the same agent. The current active deployment is marked "},{"id":"spn-73372","marks":["code"],"text":"rolled_back"},{"id":"spn-73373","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43921","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73374","text":"AgentCore Container Build Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-43922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73375","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-73376","marks":["code"],"text":"runtime=agentcore"},{"id":"spn-73377","text":", the control plane converts the uploaded bundle into a container image:"}]},{"id":"blk-43923","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Extract and validate archive\n2. Build user code (TypeScript -> Node.js 20 artifact)\n3. Generate HTTP wrapper (invoke/v1 handler)\n4. Build OCI container image\n5. Push to ECR registry\n6. Create/update AgentCore runtime with image URI\n7. Inject env vars (telemetry key + user secrets)"},{"id":"blk-43924","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73378","text":"The pipeline is idempotent per "},{"id":"spn-73379","marks":["code"],"text":"deployment_id"},{"id":"spn-73380","text":" -- retries produce the same provider state."}]},{"id":"blk-43925","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73381","text":"Concurrent Deploy Guard"}]},{"id":"blk-43926","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73382","text":"Only one deployment can be in "},{"id":"spn-73383","marks":["code"],"text":"deploying"},{"id":"spn-73384","text":" status per agent at a time. The Edge Function must check for existing in-progress deployments and reject concurrent attempts with an appropriate error."}]},{"id":"blk-43927","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-73385","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-43928","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73386","text":"[ ] Bundle includes valid "},{"id":"spn-73387","marks":["code"],"text":"agent.config.json"}]}],"id":"blk-43929","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43932","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73388","text":"[ ] Entrypoint file exists"}]}],"id":"blk-43931","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73389","text":"[ ] Runtime matches agent configuration"}]}],"id":"blk-43933","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43936","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73390","text":"[ ] Version is monotonically increasing"}]}],"id":"blk-43935","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73391","text":"[ ] Bundle passes size and file count limits"}]}],"id":"blk-43937","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43940","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73392","text":"[ ] No concurrent deploys for the same agent"}]}],"id":"blk-43939","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43942","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73393","text":"[ ] Secrets referenced in manifest exist in Vault"}]}],"id":"blk-43941","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43944","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73394","text":"[ ] Deployment record is immutable after creation (except status/error)"}]}],"id":"blk-43943","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-73395","text":"[ ] AgentCore builds produce deterministic container images"}]}],"id":"blk-43945","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraq5ddoiiknetylbhnlsn7oplttaz43uv25ccsmdjlmrwqlbqmleia","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}